# Written by newer IDEs when they open an older package
*.otares

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored: *.dof and *.cfg below Source/Packages.
# They carry the package search path and output directory. Without them
# SynEdit.inc cannot find its SynEditJedi.inc and a fresh clone will not build.
# The Delphi 7 IDE regenerates the .cfg from the .dof on every build, so seeing
# it in a diff is expected, not a defect.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dictionary of the spell check suite (15.9 MB binary blob, never changes and
# is not needed to compile). It ships with the spell check distribution the
# units came from.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dictionary.7z

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local deployment staging area (a copy of the tree plus the dictionary, 23 MB).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_Data/
